  - title: "01 / Wire the R\u20132R ladder"
    explanation: "W01 BIT2 \u2192 B2_R_IN. W02 BIT1 \u2192 B1_R_IN. W03 BIT0 \u2192
      B0_R_IN. W04 B2_R_OUT \u2192 LINK21_IN. W05 LINK21_OUT \u2192 B1_R_OUT. W06
      B1_R_OUT \u2192 LINK10_IN. W07 LINK10_OUT \u2192 B0_R_OUT. W08 B0_R_OUT \u2192
      TERM_R_IN. W09 TERM_OUT \u2192 DAC_RETURN."
    caption: "R = 10 k\u03A9  \u2022  2R = 20 k\u03A9"
    parts:
    - id: out
      kind: 9
