  - title: 02 / Compare the bit weights
    explanation: Apply 001, 010, and 100 to measure the bits individually. B2 contributes
      four steps, B1 contributes two, and B0 contributes one. Use those weights to
      find the code for 3.125 V.
    caption: "001 = 0.625 V  \u2022  010 = 1.250 V  \u2022  100 = 2.500 V"
    parts:
    - id: out
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.78}
