  - title: 03 / Find the open termination
    explanation: First apply 111 with the link closed. Then open the link while keeping
      111 applied. With the path to return open and all three bits high, the output
      rises toward the reference. Select OPEN TERMINATION.
    caption: "111  \u2022  HEALTHY 4.375 V  \u2022  OPEN LINK \u2248 5.000 V"
    parts:
    - id: out
      kind: 9
