  - title: 04 / Restore and sweep
    explanation: Restore the link and run the sweep from 000 through 111. The readings
      rise from 0.000 V to 4.375 V in seven equal steps. Full scale is one step below
      the 5 V reference.
    caption: "EIGHT LEVELS  \u2022  SEVEN STEPS OF 0.625 V"
    parts:
